#: src/Privacy.php:109
msgid "When you ask for your personal data, it includes the wallet data of your orders, and the transfers that paid none of your orders but came from a number or InstaPay address that paid one of them. When you ask us to erase your personal data, we erase the payer's number and name of those transfers, except a transfer we still have to settle, such as money we may need to return, whose data is erased at the end of the period above. The wallet data of an order is erased with the order's personal data."
msgstr ""

